#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#Region # Process Summary
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

#<Process Description>
# This process ruupdates the lock Month for the particular outlook month

#<Changes Log>
# V1 - 25/11/2022 - Jithu Varghese - CPM Group - First draft

#<Maintenance Log\>

#<Execute Method>
# Daily Schedule
#<Execute Method\>

